| !Boot file for !Journal: the Filer runs it when it first shows the
| application, so its icons and the file type of a locked journal
| page are known.
Set Journal$Dir <Obey$Dir>
IconSprites <Obey$Dir>.!Sprites
Set File$Type_1C6 Journal
| double-clicking a locked page opens it in the Journal (%% is a %:
| Obey would put its own parameters in place of a plain %*0)
Set Alias$@RunType_1C6 Run <Journal$Dir>.!Run %%*0
